    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into the adrenaline-pumping world of Pirend7, where high-speed racing collides with explosive combat in a 32-player battle royale! In this sci-fi racer, survival isn't just about speed; it's about strategy, firepower, and skill. Whether you're gunning for the finish line or fighting to be the last one standing, every race is a test of wits, reflexes, and pure combat prowess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH THE POWER OF THE PIRENDS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/9c8170bd0f4e77bbf05b071650402ab5.poster.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/9c8170bd0f4e77bbf05b071650402ab5.webm?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/9c8170bd0f4e77bbf05b071650402ab5.mp4?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars of the show are the Pirends\u2014futuristic, heavily armed vehicles built for speed, destruction, and strategic dominance. Each Pirend is part of a distinct class, offering unique passive, primary, and ultimate abilities that can give you the edge in combat. Whether you\u2019re dominating the battlefield with raw firepower or outsmarting opponents with strategic precision, your choice of class and abilities will define your approach to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVERSE WEAPON ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/6daeeac0a861b2f2324a1858b05746d5.poster.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/6daeeac0a861b2f2324a1858b05746d5.webm?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/6daeeac0a861b2f2324a1858b05746d5.mp4?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your Pirend with an array of over 25 weapons that suit your combat style. Whether you prefer the precision of rifles, the raw power of cannons, the close-range devastation of shotguns, or the relentless spray of machine guns, your loadout can be tailored for any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL GADGETRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/55716f9c875c4ebff24647bacb8bc051.poster.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/55716f9c875c4ebff24647bacb8bc051.webm?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/55716f9c875c4ebff24647bacb8bc051.mp4?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the battlefield with up to three tactical gadgets. Choose from 7 unique gadgets, like deploying a &quot;Shield Barrier&quot; to absorb incoming fire, dropping a &quot;Smokescreen&quot; to lose pursuers, or amplifying your firepower with a &quot;Weapon Amplifier.&quot; Gadgets offer a wide range of strategic options that can turn the tide of any encounter, and with the ability to swap gadgets mid-game, you can adapt to any situation on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADVANCED MISSILE SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/51f017ca1f6ffaaef07312571f12a6e5.poster.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/51f017ca1f6ffaaef07312571f12a6e5.webm?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/51f017ca1f6ffaaef07312571f12a6e5.mp4?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Pirend is equipped with a versatile missile launcher, capable of firing 7 specialized missiles to suit your needs. Whether you need to punch through armor with an &quot;Anti-Armor Missile,&quot; disable enemy shields with an &quot;Anti-Shield Missile,&quot; or scramble electronics with an &quot;EMP Missile,&quot; your missile launcher is your go-to tool for dealing serious damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AUGMENT SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/205c3bec554abe252f2085b29df5b769.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you race and battle, you'll unlock random augments that enhance your Pirend's capabilities. With 40 different augments available, you can reduce the cooldown of your gadgets, double your missile launcher's firepower, or fortify your shields, allowing you to adapt and evolve your strategy on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC RACE TRACKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race tracks in Pirend7 start wide and gradually narrow, pushing players into intense close-quarters combat. Get ready to fight for every inch of road!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to dive into the adrenaline-pumping world of Pirend7, where high-speed racing collides with explosive combat in a 32-player battle royale! In this sci-fi racer, survival isn't just about speed; it's about strategy, firepower, and skill. Whether you're gunning for the finish line or fighting to be the last one standing, every race is a test of wits, reflexes, and pure combat prowess. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLEASH THE POWER OF THE PIRENDS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/9c8170bd0f4e77bbf05b071650402ab5.poster.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/9c8170bd0f4e77bbf05b071650402ab5.webm?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/9c8170bd0f4e77bbf05b071650402ab5.mp4?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stars of the show are the Pirends\u2014futuristic, heavily armed vehicles built for speed, destruction, and strategic dominance. Each Pirend is part of a distinct class, offering unique passive, primary, and ultimate abilities that can give you the edge in combat. Whether you\u2019re dominating the battlefield with raw firepower or outsmarting opponents with strategic precision, your choice of class and abilities will define your approach to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVERSE WEAPON ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste