ncounter, and with the ability to swap gadgets mid-game, you can adapt to any situation on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADVANCED MISSILE SYSTEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/51f017ca1f6ffaaef07312571f12a6e5.poster.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/51f017ca1f6ffaaef07312571f12a6e5.webm?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/51f017ca1f6ffaaef07312571f12a6e5.mp4?t=1748300161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Pirend is equipped with a versatile missile launcher, capable of firing 7 specialized missiles to suit your needs. Whether you need to punch through armor with an &quot;Anti-Armor Missile,&quot; disable enemy shields with an &quot;Anti-Shield Missile,&quot; or scramble electronics with an &quot;EMP Missile,&quot; your missile launcher is your go-to tool for dealing serious damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AUGMENT SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176460/extras/205c3bec554abe252f2085b29df5b769.avif?t=1748300161\" width=600 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you race and battle, you'll unlock random augments that enhance your Pirend's capabilities. With 40 different augments available, you can reduce the cooldown of your gadgets, double your missile launcher's firepower, or fortify your shields, allowing you to adapt and evolve your strategy on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC RACE TRACKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race tracks in Pirend7 start wide and gradually narrow, pushing players into intense close-quarters combat. Get ready to fight for every inch of road!</p>",
    "short_description": "Pirend7 is a multiplayer sci-fi combat racing game for 32 players. Outsmart opponents with strategic use of weapons, gadgets, and missiles in a high-speed, rogue-like race. With a dynamic track and permadeath, race to be the first to the finish line or the last one standing.",
